								zh="在默认 $T = 0.7$ 下，候选词【考】以 $90.3\%$ 基础概率（Top-p 归一化后达 $92.9\%$）胜出，拼装成句“人工智能能够思考”。历史词元的 Key 与 Value 永久驻留在显存 KV Cache 中，新词追加缓存末尾。自回归步骤以 $\mathcal{O}(1)$ 增量计算复杂度持续向后生成，驱动因果流循环推进。"
								en="Under default $T = 0.7$, token [考] wins with $90.3\%$ base probability ($92.9\%$ after Top-p renormalization), assembling '人工智能能够思考'. Predecessor Keys and Values stay pinned in the KV Cache; appending the new token enables subsequent forward steps at $\mathcal{O}(1)$ incremental complexity."
